<h2>How the two appeals diverged</h2>
<div class="compare">
  <div class="col old"><strong>A-2 (Warsi): bail refused</strong><br/>Alleged harbouring of an apprehended operative; alleged active participation in IED-making; strong Delhi roots said to have helped co-accused find residence — heightening the witness-influence risk; allegations prima facie true under Section 43D(5).</div>
